th=\"+4pt\" lspace=\"4pt\" width=\"+8pt\"><mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mtext>&nbsp;for all&nbsp;</mtext><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo></mpadded></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
